{"4977510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drone Tanks", "steam_appid": 4977510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, endure, and discover the truth concealed beneath the earth after being thrown into a dangerous world overrun by drone adversaries with an agile and unconventional tank that can glide through danger and strike with its hammer to rescue the adorable creatures known as gemlings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Paced Combat - </strong>Soar across the battlefield in a flying tank, mastering movement to dodge attacks, bonk and uppercut enemies with a hammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c35c05d6c34c243a8a588e78ff949715.poster.avif?t=1787651176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c35c05d6c34c243a8a588e78ff949715.webm?t=1787651176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c35c05d6c34c243a8a588e78ff949715.mp4?t=1787651176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelike Progression &amp; Build Synergies </strong>– Experiment with randomized upgrades, discover powerful combinations, and create a new strategy every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c81e8f1eba6d818440c80bac8f1f70f0.poster.avif?t=1787651176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c81e8f1eba6d818440c80bac8f1f70f0.webm?t=1787651176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c81e8f1eba6d818440c80bac8f1f70f0.mp4?t=1787651176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rescue Gemlings - </strong>Protect the sweet little crystal buddies from the security bots gone rogue.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/adc2502f1087afef3f4fc2890b8b8be4.poster.avif?t=1787651176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/adc2502f1087afef3f4fc2890b8b8be4.webm?t=1787651176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/adc2502f1087afef3f4fc2890b8b8be4.mp4?t=1787651176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle, endure, and discover the truth concealed beneath the earth after being thrown into a dangerous world overrun by drone adversaries with an agile and unconventional tank that can glide through danger and strike with its hammer to rescue the adorable creatures known as gemlings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Paced Combat - </strong>Soar across the battlefield in a flying tank, mastering movement to dodge attacks, bonk and uppercut enemies with a hammer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977510/extras/c35c05d6c34c243a8a588e78ff949715.poster.avif?t=1787651176\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/